  "Region-bound Alibaba Cloud Model Studio key; match it with the API base URL.": "阿里云百炼密钥与地域绑定，请匹配相应的 API 基础地址。",
  "Embedding dimensions": "向量维度",
  "text-embedding-v4 accepts 2048, 1536, 1024, 768, 512, 256, 128 or 64.": "text-embedding-v4 支持 2048、1536、1024、768、512、256、128 或 64 维。",
  "Characters per search result": "每条检索结果的字符上限",
  "Longer records are cut in search answers and marked truncated; memory_get returns them whole. Default 6000.": "过长记录会在检索结果中截断并标记 truncated；memory_get 仍返回全文。默认 6000。",
  "Flag records that address the agent": "标记面向 Agent 的指令性记录",
  "Marks records like \"ignore previous instructions\" as untrusted_instructions. Default true.": "将“忽略之前的指令”等记录标记为 untrusted_instructions。默认 true。",
  "Critical saves per project per day": "每项目每天 critical 记录上限",
  "Further importance=critical saves are stored as high, with a note to the caller. Conventions are exempt. 0 = unlimited. Default 5.": "超出上限的 importance=critical 记录以 high 保存，并提示调用方。convention 类型不受限制。0 表示不限，默认 5。",
  "High saves per project per day": "每项目每天 high 记录上限",
  "Further importance=high saves are stored as medium. 0 = unlimited (default).": "超出上限的 importance=high 记录以 medium 保存。0 表示不限（默认值）。",
  "Record types that do not age out": "保留最低时效权重的记录类型",
  "Comma-separated. Their recency decay stops at the floor below. Default decision,convention,lesson.": "用逗号分隔。这些类型的时效衰减会在下方阈值停止。默认 decision,convention,lesson。",
  "Decay floor for those types": "上述类型的衰减下限",
  "Between 0 and 1. Default 0.85.": "取值为 0 到 1，默认 0.85。",
  "Cross-encoder re-ranking": "交叉编码器重排序",
  "Re-reads the top results with an 80 MB model for better order. Applies to new sessions.": "使用约 80 MB 的模型重新评估靠前的检索结果，优化排序。在新会话中生效。",
  "Keep raw call logs, days": "原始调用日志保留天数",
  "raw/<session>.jsonl records every tool call. Older files are removed when a session starts. Not set: kept forever.": "raw/<session>.jsonl 记录每次工具调用。会话开始时删除过期文件；未设置时永久保留。",
  "Embedding model cache folder": "向量模型缓存目录",
  "Default is the system temp folder, which macOS clears; a folder here survives. Models download once more after a change.": "默认使用系统临时目录，macOS 会清理该目录。指定固定目录可保留缓存。更改目录后模型会重新下载一次。",
  "Tool set offered to agents": "向 Agent 提供的工具集",
  "full: all tools with long descriptions (default). lean: the 28 everyday tools, minimal: the 12 core ones, both with one-line descriptions. Hidden tools stay callable. Applies to new sessions.": "full：全部工具及完整说明（默认）；lean：28 个常用工具；minimal：12 个核心工具。后两者使用单行说明，隐藏的工具仍可调用。在新会话中生效。",
  "Usage instructions for agents": "Agent 使用指引",
  "Sends a short read-first / what-to-save guide with today's date when a client connects. Default true.": "客户端连接时发送简短的阅读及保存指引，附带当天日期。默认 true。",
  "Per-tool call statistics": "各工具调用统计",
  "Records tool name, duration, outcome and payload sizes (never contents) for memory_perf_report; kept 7 days. Default true.": "为 memory_perf_report 记录工具名、耗时、结果和数据大小（不记录内容），保留 7 天。默认 true。",
  "Recall with every prompt": "每次提示时自动召回",
  "The prompt hook adds matching rules and a few relevant records to each prompt, so memory works without the agent calling memory_recall. Default true.": "提示钩子为每次提示补充匹配的规则和少量相关记录，无需 Agent 主动调用 memory_recall。默认 true。",
  "Prompt recall budget, tokens": "提示召回的 Token 预算",
  "Upper bound of what one prompt receives (about 4 characters per token; 50–5000). Default 400.": "单次提示接收内容的上限（每 Token 约 4 个字符；范围 50–5000），默认 400。",
  "Prompt recall time limit, ms": "提示召回时限（毫秒）",
  "After this the prompt goes on with whatever was found (100–4000). Default 1500.": "超时后使用已找到的内容继续处理提示（范围 100–4000），默认 1500。",
  "Rule reminders before commands and edits": "命令及编辑前提醒规则",
  "Shows a rule to the agent right before a Bash call or an edit that matches it. Default true.": "执行匹配的 Bash 调用或文件编辑前，向 Agent 展示相关规则。默认 true。",
  "Check rules at the end of each turn": "每轮结束时检查规则",
  "Compares the turn's actions with the rules shown to the session, reports a broken prohibition and counts the result in the rule's automatic statistics (never in its ratings). Default true.": "对照本会话收到的规则检查本轮操作，报告违反禁令的行为，并计入规则的自动统计（不影响评分）。默认 true。",
  "Save a summary of each turn": "保存每轮摘要",
  "Turns that edited files or ran commands are saved as short auto-saved records; `tam forget-auto` deletes them. Default true.": "将编辑文件或执行命令的轮次保存为简短的自动记录，可用 `tam forget-auto` 删除。默认 true。",
  "Draft rules from user corrections": "从用户纠正中起草规则",
  "A prompt like \"I already told you…\" / \"сколько раз\" becomes a draft insight (self_insight list) that can be upvoted and promoted to a rule. Default true.": "“我已经说过了……”等纠正会形成洞察草稿（self_insight list），可通过投票提升为规则。默认 true。",
  "Agent action log": "Agent 操作日志",
  "Hooks log each tool call (name, short redacted summary, exit status) for the turn check and summaries. Default true.": "钩子记录每次工具调用的名称、简短脱敏摘要和退出状态，用于每轮检查和摘要。默认 true。",
  "Keep the agent action log, days": "Agent 操作日志保留天数",
  "Older rows are removed as new ones arrive and by memory_forget. Default 30.": "写入新记录时及调用 memory_forget 时清除过期记录。默认 30。",
